    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「うん。合唱部はあちこち飛び回って、仕事したりコンクールに出場したりしてるんだって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしも転校生くんから、それとなく事情は聞いてるけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「彼、いつものように荷物運びとかして手伝ってるんだよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ごめんね、わたしも何か協力できたらよかったんだけど……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「美術部のほうもずっと修羅場でね、そっちに集中しなきゃいけなかったから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
